The Tiered Permission Architecture for Human-AI Governance

F.1 The Tier Structure

Definition F.1.1 (Tiered Permission Matrix):

\mathbf{P}_t \in \{0, 1, 2, 3, 4\}^{m \times n}

where each entry specifies the governance tier for a particular action.

Definition F.1.2 (Tier Definitions):

Tier Name Description
