K.10 The Capability Dividend Calculation

```
+================================================================================+
|           CAPABILITY DIVIDEND (TCD) CALCULATION                              |
+================================================================================+
|                                                                                |
|   COUNTERFACTUAL DEFINITION:                                                  |
|                                                                                |
|   TCD(T) = E_{pi_T}[sum_{tau=t+1}^{T} gamma^tau r(X_tau)]                     |
|           - E_{pi_T^0}[sum_{tau=t+1}^{T} gamma^tau r(X_tau^0)]               |
|                                                                                |
|   +----------------------------------------------------------------+          |
|   |                    POLICY pi_T (WITH CAPABILITY)               |          |
|   |                                                                 |          |
|   |   t=0    t=1    t=2    t=3    ...    t=T                       |          |
|   |   |------|------|------|------|------|                          |          |
|   |   S_0 -> S_1 -> S_2 -> S_3 -> ... -> S_T                       |          |
|   |   K_0 -> K_1 -> K_2 -> K_3 -> ... -> K_T  (INVESTED)           |          |
|   |                                                                 |          |
|   |   Reward: R_B = sum gamma^t r(X_t)                             |          |
|   +----------------------------------------------------------------+          |
|                                                                                |
|   +----------------------------------------------------------------+          |
|   |                    POLICY pi_T^0 (WITHOUT CAPABILITY)          |          |
|   |                                                                 |          |
|   |   t=0    t=1    t=2    t=3    ...    t=T                       |          |
|   |   |------|------|------|------|------|                          |          |
|   |   S_0 -> S_1 -> S_2 -> S_3 -> ... -> S_T'                      |          |
|   |   K_0 -> K_0 -> K_0 -> K_0 -> ... -> K_0  (NOT INVESTED)       |          |
|   |                                                                 |          |
|   |   Reward: R_A = sum gamma^t r(X_t')                            |          |
|   +----------------------------------------------------------------+          |
|                                                                                |
|   =========================================================================    |
|                                                                                |
|   TCD = R_B - R_A                                                            |
|                                                                                |
|   If TCD > 0: Capability investment generates net positive value              |
|   If TCD < 0: Capability investment does not justify cost                     |
|                                                                                |
|   =========================================================================    |
|                                                                                |
|   MARGINAL APPROXIMATION:                                                     |
|                                                                                |
|   TCD ~= nabla_K V(X_t) . Delta K(T)                                         |
|                                                                                |
|   where nabla_K V(X_t) = partial V / partial K                                |
|                                                                                |
+================================================================================+
```

